{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L4--5 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: collect_ordered_chain\n- L8--10 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: collect_ordered_chain, stage_chain_blockers\n- L13--14 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: collect_ordered_chain\n- L17--18 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: distribute_chain_to_rails\n- L21--23 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: collect_ordered_chain, relay_chain_around_barrier\n- L26--29 `def play_level_6(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_sk48_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_3xfl_99`\n- L32--35 `def play_level_7(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_sk48_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_4xvmi6o`\n\n## legs.py\n- L5--68 `def collect_ordered_chain(env, clearance=None, lowest_first=False):` — Extend a row-mounted gripper to collect the colors shown in its order strip.; calls: RuntimeError, arr, board_blocks, clearance, connected_components, int, len, max, min, safe_step, +2\n- L71--151 `def stage_chain_blockers(env):` — Park obstructing blocks on empty rows, with room for an ordered chain.; calls: RuntimeError, all, arr, block, blocks, collect_ordered_chain, connected_components, enumerate, head, len, +7\n- L154--202 `def clear_chain_guide(env):` — Find a short vertical escape from a guide that prevents chain pulling.; calls: RuntimeError, all, arr, connected_components, deque, int, len, next, pullable, range, +3\n- L205--295 `def distribute_chain_to_rails(env, beam_width=100, max_depth=90):` — Distribute linked cargo into the vertical orders shown beside rail IDs.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, all, arr, connected_components, enumerate, int, len, max, next, +6\n- L298--332 `def relay_chain_around_barrier(env):` — Use released cargo as vertical push relays around a shaft barrier.; calls: RuntimeError, collect_ordered_chain, connected_components, len, max, min, safe_step\n- L335--405 `def exchange_cargo_between_shafts(env):` — Hand crossed cargo orders between perpendicular, selectable grippers.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, any, connected_components, int, len, max, min, move_to, safe_step, +1\n- L408--495 `def assemble_intersecting_chains(env):` — Assemble perpendicular three-link orders around one shared middle block.; calls: RuntimeError, abs, column, connected_components, int, len, max, min, move, next, +3\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48--79 `def connected_components(frame, colors: Optional[Iterable[int]] = None, min_area: int = 1) -> List[Blob]:`; calls: Blob, arr, int, len, max, min, range, sorted, sum\n- L82--89 `def block_signatures(frame, cell: int = 4) -> Dict[Tuple[int, int], Tuple[int, ...]]:` — Partition a frame into fixed cells and return each cell's color signature.; calls: arr, int, range, sorted, tuple\n- L92--110 `def object_candidates(frame, cell: int = 4, min_area: int = 4) -> List[dict]:` — A compact, game-agnostic object list from color components and cell signatures.; calls: arr, block_signatures, connected_components\n- L113--123 `def frame_delta(before, after) -> dict:`; calls: arr, int, len, zip\n- L126--156 `def normalize_public_action(action):` — Validate one public key or coordinate action without touching ``env``.; calls: ValueError, any, int, isinstance, len, range\n- L159--166 `def safe_step(env, action):` — Validate locally, then apply one public key or coordinate action.; calls: isinstance, normalize_public_action\n- L169--182 `def action_deltas(env, actions=None) -> Dict[object, dict]:` — Compare valid cloned actions; bare ACTION6 is never sent to the arena.; calls: arr, frame_delta, normalize_public_action, safe_step, tuple\n- L185--194 `def replay(env, actions: Sequence):`; calls: normalize_public_action, safe_step, tuple\n- L197--205 `def path_result(env, actions: Sequence[int]) -> dict:`; calls: bool, color_counts, int, len, object_candidates, replay\n- L208--213 `def changed_signature(env, actions: Sequence[int], cell: int = 4):`; calls: block_signatures, replay, set, sorted\n- L216--243 `def bounded_bfs(env, goal_fn, actions=None, key_fn=None, max_states: int = 20000, max_depth: int = 80):` — BFS over advertised key actions by default; use small bounds first.; calls: arr, deque, goal_fn, key_fn, len, normalize_public_action, safe_step, tuple\n- L246--287 `def bounded_replay_bfs(env, goal_fn, action_fn, key_fn=None, max_states: int = 20000, max_depth: int = 80):` — Path-only BFS for games whose deep Arena clones become expensive.; calls: action_fn, arr, deque, goal_fn, key_fn, len, normalize_public_action, reconstruct, safe_step, tuple\n- L290--291 `def level_goal(base_level: int):`\n\n## solve.py\n- L3--13 `def solve(env): # dispatch to the per-level player for the current level, in a loop`; calls: fn, getattr\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
